2026-08-09T06:52:05Z   ANALYSIS: UBER_MARKETING_REVIEW_2026-08-09.md. Mari marketing intensity has risen from 9.2% of sales (Apr 5-Jul 12, 15 wks) to 12.3% (Jul 13-Aug 8) while weekly sales fell ~26% - spend per week is flat, the rate rose because the denominator shrank. +3.1pp is ~$519/4wks, ~$6.7k/yr at current volume. No measured evidence of incremental lift: the 5 lowest-intensity weeks averaged $6,457 sales vs $5,345 for the 5 highest, and the r=+0.77 correlation is mechanical (funded offers are a % of order value). Only 1 of 27 days carried zero marketing so there is no natural control - recommended an alternating-weeks off test, starting with Uber Ads.
